{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"c6b84722-083b-46cb-8d5b-381bc78d77bb","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-PRO-SCAN-BACKEND-FRONTEND-20260818","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-18T03:04:59.115Z","conclusion":{"id":"a98d68f1-09a7-46f0-b714-df885c9d6ba2","status":"PROVEN","text":"Weekly、Yearly、Lifetime 三种商品在 Flutter 配置中都映射到同一个 entitlement_id=performance_pro；扫描接口不区分订阅套餐，只区分 premium/free/sync_required。","evidence":["apps/flutter-app/lib/features/subscription/subscription_controller.dart:43-61,593-607","apps/workers-api/src/entitlements/premium-access.ts:3-6"]}}
