{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"ccbca5be-832b-4c57-bf99-ea9c398f865b","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-PRO-SCAN-BACKEND-FRONTEND-20260818","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-18T03:05:16.859Z","conclusion":{"id":"8971cc6b-df51-46aa-9ace-cfd1b8d38ad8","status":"PROVEN","text":"服务端有防误扣分支：如果当前 session 没有 grant，但客户端发送 X-Local-Premium-State: verified，resolvePremiumAccess 返回 sync_required，recognize 在调用 reserveScanQuota 前返回 409，所以该情形不会创建 Free 额度记录。","evidence":["apps/flutter-app/lib/shared/scan/scan_api_client.dart:278-285,304-326","apps/workers-api/src/entitlements/premium-access.ts:45-52","apps/workers-api/src/scan/routes.ts:234-247"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"28dd807d-6679-4eb2-8acb-9096c72800c9","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-PRO-SCAN-BACKEND-FRONTEND-20260818","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-18T03:05:29.361Z","conclusion":{"id":"a7f7a73e-bb51-406b-93e8-d6d7c8c2d082","status":"PROVEN","text":"真实扣减只会在服务端同时看到‘无有效 session grant’和‘请求没有 verified header’时发生，此时 access 被判为 free。Flutter 的 header 完全取决于本机 subscriptionController.isPro，而扫描前仅对 unknown 刷新，已经误判为 free 时会直接发请求。因此按当前代码，若发生真实扣减，直接触发点是前端未携带 Pro 信号与服务端 grant 缺失的组合；额度模块本身是按收到的 free 判定正确记账。","evidence":["apps/flutter-app/lib/features/scan/scan_page.dart:719-737","apps/flutter-app/lib/features/scan/scan_result_source.dart:123-132,304-313","apps/workers-api/src/entitlements/premium-access.ts:45-52","apps/workers-api/src/scan/routes.ts:234-247"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"2f2aa2a9-178f-420d-8d42-2fb660a0a96f","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-PRO-SCAN-BACKEND-FRONTEND-20260818","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-18T03:05:39.286Z","conclusion":{"id":"c6b72785-2e63-4d53-986e-df2298f1f2ef","status":"PROVEN","text":"接口契约另有后端缺口：GET /scan/quota 返回 unlimited，但成功 POST /scan/recognize 的 quota 不含 unlimited。Flutter 将缺失字段解析为 false 并覆盖 quota controller；扫描页展示又只看本机 isPro，不采纳服务端 unlimited。这会造成错误显示/状态回写，但本身不会把服务端 premium 记录改成 free。","evidence":["apps/workers-api/src/scan/routes.ts:182-205,408-437","apps/flutter-app/lib/shared/scan/scan_api_client.dart:58-80","apps/flutter-app/lib/features/scan/scan_page.dart:1159-1164,1860-1865,1938-1939"]}}
{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"c4c13f95-1430-4e7b-ae99-f82a49209672","workItemId":"ANALYSIS-PRO-SCAN-BACKEND-FRONTEND-20260818","action":"analysis-conclusion-added","timestamp":"2026-08-18T03:05:45.869Z","conclusion":{"id":"26f87703-7dd4-4a11-bb16-ac026cece945","status":"UNKNOWN","text":"仅凭仓库代码不能确认用户本次请求实际携带的 header、服务端是否存在 session grant，以及账本记录是 premium 还是 free。要对单次事件归责，需要 request_id 对应的请求头、billing_session_entitlement_grant 和 scan_quota_request.access_mode/status；未读取远程日志或数据库。","evidence":[]}}
